* Dependabot credential proxy
** Separation
*** Updater: no secrets
*** Proxy: credentials and CA key
*** Internal network
** Request chain
*** TLS interception
*** Egress check before credentials
*** One handler per registry
** Credential use
*** GET and HEAD only
*** Git: fetches only
*** Repository scope and OIDC
left side
** Internal targets
*** Metadata host blocked
*** IP checked at the socket
** Egress allowlist
*** Off by default
*** Observe, then enforce
*** Exact dynamic hosts
*** Accepted: storage.googleapis.com
** What remains
*** Read what the job can read
*** Exfiltration if not enforced
*** Pull request content
@endmindmap
